cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Cello in a project, cite this software release."
title: "Cello: Biochemical Cell Simulator"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Bitar
    given-names: Abdsalam
version: 3.2.0
date-released: 2026-09-20
license: LicenseRef-Proprietary
abstract: >-
  Cello is an interactive biochemical cell simulator and research-oriented
  visualization platform for Windows x64. Version 3.2 adds local model
  sensitivity analysis and reproducible Latin-hypercube uncertainty propagation
  while preserving the v3.1 kinetic and pathway-definition core.
keywords:
  - biochemistry
  - cell simulation
  - systems biology
  - sensitivity analysis
  - uncertainty analysis
  - computational biology
